# Task 18 grammar-hardening RED evidence

Each excerpt is from the focused test after the regression was added and before its production fix.
Commands used `PATH="$PWD/node_modules/.bin:$PATH" node ./vitest-test.mjs test/markdown-grammar-hardening.test.ts -t <item>`.

## (a) YAML 1.2 scalar spellings

```text
test/markdown-grammar-hardening.test.ts (3 tests | 3 failed)
Expected: extract/invalid-frontmatter — frontmatter field "readiness" must be a string scalar
Received: extract/non-static-envelope — readiness is not a recognized spec readiness
```

## (b) YAML diagnostic line rebasing

```text
rebases YAML-native diagnostic line text with the structured finding line
Expected substring: at line 2, column 7
Received: Anchor ending in : is ambiguous at line 1, column 7
```

## (c) Exact `...` before the required closer

```text
refuses a YAML document-end marker before the required frontmatter closer
expected [ { data: { ... }, file: "grammar-hardening.sdp.md", line: 2 } ] to deeply equal []
```

## (d) Non-mapping-root accumulated findings

```text
preserves accumulated YAML findings when the frontmatter root is not a mapping
Expected findings: YAML directives are not accepted + frontmatter must be a mapping
Received findings: frontmatter must be a mapping
```

